# Which countries' Riseup servers vpn may use: zone, then the country
# code (ISO 3166, two letters). Installed as /etc/vpn/countries; edit
# it here and run install.sh net again.
#
#   white  preferred: if any white server works, it is used, even if
#          a gray one would be faster
#   gray   used when no white one works. A country missing from this
#          list counts as gray.
#   black  only when nothing else works, and then everything goes
#          through Tor (vpn level 3)
#
# Zones beat speed; inside a zone, the fastest of 3 random servers wins.
# Nothing here depends on where you are.

# White: no surveillance pact, no law that makes a VPN log, courts
# that protect privacy. (Switzerland is planning to widen its
# surveillance law to VPNs; move it to gray if that passes.)
white CH    Switzerland
white IS    Iceland
white RO    Romania (its data retention law was struck down)
white PA    Panama

# Gray: the outer circles of the Five Eyes pact. Nine Eyes:
gray  DK    Denmark
gray  FR    France
gray  NL    Netherlands
gray  NO    Norway
# Fourteen Eyes:
gray  BE    Belgium
gray  DE    Germany
gray  IT    Italy
gray  ES    Spain
gray  SE    Sweden
# Known partners of the Five Eyes outside the pact:
gray  IL    Israel
gray  JP    Japan
gray  KR    South Korea
gray  SG    Singapore

# Black: the Five Eyes (they share almost everything they intercept,
# and can force companies to hand over data or build in access, with
# a gag order)...
black US    United States
black GB    United Kingdom
black CA    Canada
black AU    Australia
black NZ    New Zealand
# ...and countries that censor the internet, restrict VPNs or make
# VPN providers log their users.
black AE    United Arab Emirates
black BY    Belarus
black CN    China
black CU    Cuba
black EG    Egypt
black IN    India (VPNs must keep logs for 5 years)
black IR    Iran
black KP    North Korea
black MM    Myanmar
black OM    Oman
black PK    Pakistan
black QA    Qatar
black RU    Russia
black SA    Saudi Arabia
black SY    Syria
black TM    Turkmenistan
black TR    Turkey
black VN    Vietnam
